    "merck": "The Merck Index monograph for the named compound (melting point and solubility section)",
    "physchem": "the compound's published physicochemical characterisation (potentiometric or spectrophotometric pKa determination, and shake-flask or pH-metric log P determination) as collected in the medicinal-chemistry physicochemical-property literature",
